# Temporary / smoke-test configs that should never reach the launcher.
# The launcher scans this directory for *.json and registers every file
# found.  Any leftover tmp variant from a debug run would appear in the
# dropdown — including with a duplicate metadata.name if copied from a
# real config.  Ignore them here so they're also invisible to git and
# can't be accidentally committed.
_tmp_*.json
_smoke_*.json
